    "v": 2,
    "brief": "Each test sends gets and puts of values by key, 90% gets. A few keys are read far more than others (sessions and carts of people online). The tests send a slice of the full load (60,000 a second at the evening peak, against the article's 2.2 lakh), so the numbers on the canvas stay small; the full cluster is the same design with more nodes.",
